f scope: implementation, App Store submission, declaring Gate P0 or other M0 gates passed, and silently converting ambiguous evidence into approval.","status":"backlog","title":"Record and publish the Gate A0 disposition","type":"task","updated":"2026-07-15T01:04:27Z"},{"ac":"1. The exact submitted packet revision, channel, submission date, account or team context, and case or review identifier are recorded. 2. Every material Apple response and clarification is preserved in a TASK-ID-scoped outcome resource with only privacy-safe redaction. 3. Evidence identifies the architecture that Apple evaluated; any material mismatch is recorded and the evidence is not reused for a different design. 4. If Apple requests a prototype or more detail, the follow-up and resulting response are included before this task hands off. 5. The outcome is classified only as evidence captured, not as an architectural pass or fail; interpretation belongs to the dependent assessment task.","assignee":"","blockedBy":["TASK-260715-12avq0"],"blocks":["TASK-260715-x4h9n1"],"checklist":[{"text":"An accepted Apple evidence route was executed with the reviewed packet","done":false},{"text":"The full privacy-safe submission and response chain is attached","done":false},{"text":"Evidence identity, dates, and evaluated architecture revision are reproducible","done":false}],"children":[],"created":"2026-07-15T00:56:48Z","description":"Execute one accepted Gate A0 route using the reviewed disclosure packet and preserve the authoritative response trail. Use Apple Developer Technical Support, entitlement or review feedback for the accurately disclosed prototype, or an approved remote packet-semantic architecture change as the evidence source.","id":"TASK-260715-1i6bh7","isBlocked":true,"name":"obtain-authoritative-apple-a0-evidence","notes":"","outcomeResources":[],"parent":"STORY-260715-2itwz7","preconditionResources":[],"scope":"In scope: submitting the exact reviewed packet, responding to clarification r