0715-2itwz7","preconditionResources":[],"scope":"In scope: NEPacketTunnelProvider, NETunnelProviderManager, TN3120, Apple VPN routing guidance, App Review Guideline 5.4, the supplied Relux data paths, accepted Gate A0 evidence forms, access dates, and point-in-time caveats. Out of scope: contacting Apple, interpreting a future response, legal advice, changing the architecture, or writing product code.","status":"backlog","title":"Compile the Gate A0 primary-source evidence dossier","type":"task","updated":"2026-07-15T01:04:25Z"},{"ac":"1. Every conclusion cites a specific item in the captured evidence and identifies any inference. 2. The assessment uses explicit pass, fail, and ambiguous criteria and does not classify ambiguous evidence as pass. 3. For a negative or ambiguous result, at least the current design, a remote packet-semantic VPN endpoint, and any distribution-limited alternative are compared for entitlement fit, security, operational cost, product impact, and rework. 4. The report recommends one disposition and names the exact follow-up evidence or owner decision still required. 5. Downstream stories and tasks that remain blocked, may proceed as disposable spikes, or must be rewritten are listed by concrete ID and title.","assignee":"","blockedBy":["TASK-260715-1i6bh7"],"blocks":["TASK-260715-1828xy"],"checklist":[{"text":"Evidence traceability supports the stated classification","done":false},{"text":"Negative or ambiguous outcomes include viable options and tradeoffs","done":false},{"text":"The recommendation and affected board items are attached as a TASK-ID-scoped outcome resource","done":false}],"children":[],"created":"2026-07-15T00:56:48Z","description":"Evaluate the captured Apple evidence against the Gate A0 pass condition. If it is negative or ambiguous, document clean architecture options and their tradeoffs, including a remote endpoint that receives packet semantics, rather than inventing implementation workarounds.","id":"TASK-260715-x4h9n1"