+### STORY-260715-lkshfz — M0 in-process SSH engine comparison and selection (11)
+
+- TASK-260715-28ok1k — Pin and audit the SSH engine candidates.
+- TASK-260715-2ny6z4 — Record the SSH transport conformance contract.
