ze and effective limit; persistent failures produce bounded privacy-safe errors. 5. All descriptors, read sources, continuations, and tasks close exactly once under normal stop, start failure, and cancellation.","assignee":"","blockedBy":["TASK-260715-p89bdj","TASK-260715-2nfz7w","TASK-260715-pmww4f"],"blocks":["TASK-260715-3dn813","TASK-260715-1vv52g","TASK-260715-52h8i3"],"checklist":[{"text":"Bridge implementation follows the approved public-API and ownership contract","done":false},{"text":"Backpressure, EMSGSIZE, metrics, and bounded batching are implemented","done":false},{"text":"Implementation notes and verification commands are attached as a TASK-ID-scoped outcome","done":false}],"children":[],"created":"2026-07-15T01:01:35Z","description":"Implement the Swift bridge that exchanges packet batches between NEPacketTunnelFlow and the HEV descriptor endpoint through a nonblocking AF_UNIX SOCK_DGRAM socket pair, following the approved contract exactly.","id":"TASK-260715-3o0co4","isBlocked":true,"name":"implement-public-socket-pair-packet-flow-bridge","notes":"","outcomeResources":[],"parent":"STORY-260715-jnpbyz","preconditionResources":[],"scope":"In scope: socket-pair creation; close-on-exec and nonblocking configuration; socket-buffer request and effective-value readback; endpoint transfer; four-byte network-order AF_INET and AF_INET6 headers; batch reads and writes; count and time budgets; reason-specific counters; cancellation; privacy-safe failures; dependency injection. Out of scope: HEV startup, SSH, routes, DNS, private APIs, retries after bounded-queue drops, unbounded buffering, final tuning constants, and product UI.","status":"backlog","title":"Implement the public socket-pair PacketFlowBridge","type":"task","updated":"2026-07-15T01:04:29Z"},{"ac":"1. The fuzz target or deterministic Swift property harness accepts arbitrary bytes and never reads beyond frame boundaries or allocates relative to an untrusted declared length beyond the configured data